# 4-nitrothiophenol  pKa=4.710  (ArSH series, EW end)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# Strongest ArSH acid after NO2. Para-NO2 sigma_p=+0.78.
# Note: Hammett rho for ArSH is ~1.1 (larger than ArOH ~2.2),
# reflecting lower sensitivity of S-H to charge delocalisation.

